header_text {
  translation {
    text: "D Line notice: beginning Sun Jan 4."
    language: "en"
  }
}
description_text {
  translation {
    text: " Beginning Sunday, Jan. 4, our latest service changes will take effect. RTD is making changes to enhance reliability and connectivity of services, improve on-time performance, and restore regular travel patterns to rail lines that were impacted by the most recent phase of the Downtown Rail Reconstruction Project, which concluded Nov. 25. RTD’s service changes aim to enhance the overall transit experience by improving reliability and on-time performance of bus and rail services.\r\n\r\nChange\r\nThe D Line will resume its regular downtown service pattern, along with corresponding schedule adjustments.\r\n\r\nReason\r\nCompletion of project phases in the Downtown Rail Reconstruction Project allows for the D Line to return to its regular pattern.\r\n\r\nSurvey Results\r\nOut of 126 respondents, 56% reported a positive impact from the change, 7% indicated it had no impact, and 37% perceived the change negatively."
    language: "en"
  }
}
